{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"issues\":[{\"sec\":\"S01\",\"screen\":\"可心里其实很想停下来\",\"source\":\"也可以把它听成一个人强迫自己挺直背脊，提醒自己不能倒下；……——“我不能倒下，可我其实很想停下来。”\",\"type\":\"2\",\"severity\":\"严重\",\"why\":\"定稿将这句内心话限定为一种可选的听法，屏幕稿却把它写成了他确定的真实心境。\"},{\"sec\":\"S02\",\"screen\":\"可一心软，他又赶紧想起受过的气\",\"source\":\"那份舍不得一上来，他就赶紧提醒自己受过的那些气，怕一心软，连当初为什么要走都忘了。\",\"type\":\"4\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿是舍不得一出现就主动提醒自己受过的气，以免心软；屏幕稿改成心软触发对受过的气的回想，改变了提醒的因果关系。\"},{\"sec\":\"S03\",\"screen\":\"那点高兴刚退，他就酸了\",\"source\":\"可那点高兴还没退，他心里就酸了\",\"type\":\"7\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿中高兴尚未消退时酸楚就已出现，屏幕稿改成高兴刚退之后才酸，改变了两种情绪出现的先后关系。\"},{\"sec\":\"S05\",\"screen\":\"不是想通了，而是抵抗得累了\",\"source\":\"这一下松动，也像是“不是已经想通了，而是抵抗得累了”\",\"type\":\"2\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿只是把抵抗疲惫作为一种可能的解释，屏幕稿删掉了“也像是”，将猜测写成确定结论。\"},{\"sec\":\"S10\",\"screen\":\"心里又浮起一句：我究竟要怎样继续生活？\",\"source\":\"如果把这次回返听成心理上的回望，开头的试探姿态仿佛把问题重新递回来：“那么，我究竟要怎样继续生活？”\",\"type\":\"2\",\"severity\":\"严重\",\"why\":\"定稿将这个问题限定为对音乐回返的一种假设性心理解读，屏幕稿却把它直接写成了他真实浮现的内心念头。\"}]}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "5ed02488-d07d-4466-a584-4946017d7e8d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T074802484134Z", "elapsed_seconds": 403.281, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T07:54:45.789088+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "0665a655653a10ab96e6305725e0e1ac3c0ee8b75795f07fdeed35440b58e801", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T074802484134Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "dd6bcbfa2521dc8d89df9bccd2038e9ff13ce6f9c30443f4c7f2307eebd370a0"}}}
